BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:weight_training_legs_and_abs-20260731@samos
DTSTAMP:20000101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260731
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260801
SUMMARY:Weight training: Legs and abs
DESCRIPTION:Romanian deadlifts - 4 x 6-8\nHip thrusts - 4 x 8-10\nSingle-le
 g Romanian deadlifts - 3 x 8 each side\nHamstring curls - 3 x 12\nCalf rai
 ses - 4 x 15\nTibialis raises - 3 x 15\nMobility: 90/90 hips\, couch stret
 ch\, thoracic rotations\, world's greatest stretch\, and a 60-second deep
  squat hold\nFinish: 10-minute BJJ flow - shrimp\, reverse shrimp\, bridge
 s\, technical stand-ups\, sit-throughs\, sprawls\, and Granby rolls
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:weight_training_chest_and_shoulders-20260801@samos
DTSTAMP:20000101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260801
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260802
SUMMARY:Weight training: Chest and shoulders
DESCRIPTION:Pike push-ups or handstand push-up progression - 4 x 8\nDips -
  4 x 8-12\nLeaning lateral raises - 5 x 15\nRear delt fly - 4 x 15\nHammer
  curls - 4 x 10\nIncline dumbbell curls - 3 x 12\nRope pushdowns - 4 x 12\
 nFarmer carries - 3 x 40 seconds\nTowel pull-ups - 3 sets\, stopping 1-2 r
 eps before failure\nFinish: 10-minute BJJ flow - shrimp\, reverse shrimp\,
  bridges\, technical stand-ups\, sit-throughs\, sprawls\, and Granby rolls
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:sunday_planning-20260802@samos
DTSTAMP:20000101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260802
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260803
SUMMARY:Plan the upcoming week
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:weight_training_back_and_arms-20260802@samos
DTSTAMP:20000101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260802
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260803
SUMMARY:Weight training: Back and arms
DESCRIPTION:Weighted pull-ups - 5 x 5\nBodyweight pull-ups - 3 sets\, stopp
 ing 1-2 reps before failure\nChest-supported rows - 4 x 8-12\nOne-arm dumb
 bell rows - 3 x 10 each side\nFace pulls - 4 x 20\nLeaning lateral raises
  - 5 x 15\nDead hangs - 3 x 60 seconds\nHanging leg raises - 3 x 15\nFinis
 h: 10-minute BJJ flow - shrimp\, reverse shrimp\, bridges\, technical stan
 d-ups\, sit-throughs\, sprawls\, and Granby rolls
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
